/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (Aspiring to build a career in analytics-led marketing, business strategy, and techno-commercial roles. I aim to combine marketing expertise with data-driven decision-making to solve business problems and create measurable impact. I possess strong analytical, quantitative, and marketing capabilities, supported by proficiency in SQL, Python, Power BI, Tableau, Excel, and Databricks. My expertise includes market research, B2B marketing, brand management, key account management, digital strategy, and project management. I am skilled at translating complex data into actionable insights and identifying opportunities across customer, sales, and digital funnels. Currently pursuing a PGDM in marketing at JAGSoM, I have gained practical exposure to sales, marketing, and social media analytics. At Unschool, I analysed lead-conversion funnels to support business growth. At The Yellow Submarine, I contributed to content and brand strategy development. At The 4th Axis, I used social media performance and market research insights to support strategic recommendations. Through certifications and guided projects in data analytics, Agile/Scrum, SEO, CRM, cloud computing, Azure, Databricks, and project management, I am prepared to contribute at the intersection of marketing, analytics, technology, and business strategy.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
